{{Quote|I made Jedi friends because you get better prices when you drink with your clients&hellip; even if you're only drinking tea.|Antron Bach|<ref name="TeoH" />}}
'''Tea''' was a kind of non-[[alcohol]]ic beverage<ref name="TeoH" /> that was notably consumed by the [[Alderaanian|people]] of [[Alderaan]]<ref name="Leia 4">[[Princess Leia 4|''Princess Leia'' 4]]</ref> and [[Mandalorian|those]] of [[Mandalore]].<ref name="Corruption">{{TCW|Corruption (episode)}}</ref> There existed many types of tea. One was made from the florets of the [[Cassius tree]].<ref name="Eminence">{{TCW|Eminence (episode)}}</ref> Another, known as [[Tarine tea]], was served on [[planet]]s as diverse as [[Lothal]]<ref name="EotG">''[[Servants of the Empire: Edge of the Galaxy]]''</ref> and [[Christophsis]].<ref name="TCWf" /> [[Gatalenta]] was a planet famous for [[Gatalentan tea|its tea]].<ref name="Bloodline">[[Bloodline (novel)|''Bloodline'']]</ref> One tea was the [[Deychin tea]].<ref name="Aftermath: Empire's End">''[[Aftermath: Empire's End]]''</ref> While some varieties of tea were consumed hot,<ref name="Leia 4" /> others were served cold, such as [[Moogan Tea]]<ref name="Cookbook" /> or its corporate-branded version, [[Ardees Beverage]], which came in bottles<ref name="Corruption" /> or as a fizzy canned tea.<ref name="Rebel in the Ranks">''[[Servants of the Empire: Rebel in the Ranks]]''</ref> [[Teahouse]]s were establishments dedicated to the serving of tea.<ref name="Bloodline" /> Sky Graf had fifty-seven percent oxidized green [[Orsh Mountain tea]] onboard the ''[[Brightbird]]'' which he served to [[Rooper Nitani]] on [[Batuu]].<ref name="QfPX">''[[The High Republic: Quest for Planet X]]''</ref>

At some point during the [[Clone Wars]], [[smuggler]]s led by a [[Moogan]] named [[Tee Va]] came to [[Sundari]], the [[capital]] [[city]] of Mandalore, where they distributed Ardees beverage tea diluted with [[slabin]], a hazardous chemical. As a result, Tee Va's profits were doubled, but many Sundari [[Youngling|schoolchildren]] became ill. However, due to to an investigation run by the [[Duchess]] of Mandalore, [[Satine Kryze]], and the [[Galactic Republic]] [[Senator]] [[Padmé Amidala Naberrie|Padmé Amidala]], Tee Va and his smugglers were arrested.<ref name="Corruption" />

